window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Crowns of Magic Universe</b></p> <p>Los Angeles has fallen to darkness, and it’s only a matter of time before other cities follow. Where will be next? No one knows, and no one is safe from the seven Princes of Hell and their followers.</p> <p>As for me, I have a job to do—find the rest of the Vindix. But first, I’ve been summoned. The vampire royals in Isila have demanded an audience with Tobias and me. So we journey to the realm of Isila, a world as perilous as our own, and wouldn’t you know it, chaos that will change the course of my mission ensues. And I still have to find the rest of the Vindix....</p>"; 
